  "title": "Patsy's Half-Baked Blueberry Pie",
  "description": "Patsy's half-baked blueberry pie recipe has a layer of cream cheese topped with fresh blueberries, coated with a blueberry filling, and served chilled.",
  "authors": [
    "Ken Rosenfeld"
  ],
